{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/f780a9a9b6f3d61dd0ac59529e583b8c.avif?t=1764788356\" width=1560 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>The</strong>\u00a0<strong>Golden Caravan</strong>, kid. A place where fortunes are made, loyalties are lost, and every hand could be your last. Set in a smoky <strong>noir-inspired 1930s underworld</strong>, this joint ain\u2019t run by mobsters... birds with sharp suits and cold hearts are the ones calling the shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You walk the streets as <strong>Charlie Colombo</strong>, a slick pigeon with more guts than sense. When his grandfather\u00a0<strong>Carlo Colombo</strong>, a respected locksmith, is kidnapped and dragged into the infamous <strong>Golden Caravan Casino</strong>, Charlie has no other choice but to step back into the world of rigged games, feathered crime lords, and debts paid in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/3f95ebcd777a5642b315d00918e6c08c.poster.avif?t=1764788356\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/3f95ebcd777a5642b315d00918e6c08c.webm?t=1764788356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>SATISFYING POKER-BASED COMBAT</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">'Round these parts,\u00a0<strong>battles are fought at the Poker Table</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play Poker Hands to deal damage, gain armor, heal up and even stun your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/9555f5b80357349d51f2480d7ad7b33b.poster.avif?t=1764788356\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/9555f5b80357349d51f2480d7ad7b33b.webm?t=1764788356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>GAME-CHANGING TRINKETS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>Slots</strong> whisper promises... One pull, and you\u2019re hooked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hit the\u00a0<strong>Slot Machines</strong>\u00a0scattered through the casino to earn\u00a0<strong>Trinkets</strong>\u00a0that offer unique effects and gameplay twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/f200913b036b1f6453b8443b46ff19c4.poster.avif?t=1764788356\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/f200913b036b1f6453b8443b46ff19c4.webm?t=1764788356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>ENGAGING ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Climb your way to the top, one favor at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your <strong>Allies</strong> will give you <strong>Weapons</strong>, teach you <strong>Tricks</strong> and provide you other <strong>Permanent Upgrades</strong>... at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/7b401d45bce831b2abb33da3e054bf24.poster.avif?t=1764788356\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/7b401d45bce831b2abb33da3e054bf24.webm?t=1764788356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>NOIR-INSPIRED 1930s ATMOSPHERE</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cigarette smoke, jazz in the background, neon lights flickering over rain-soaked streets\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Golden Caravan</strong> it\u2019s a place you enter chasing fortune\u2026 and leave only if luck still remembers your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/f2867fc5774f22bd5fc7fe7f2976f878.poster.avif?t=1764788356\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/f2867fc5774f22bd5fc7fe7f2976f878.webm?t=1764788356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>A GAME OF PAYBACK</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every hand hides a motive... this one\u2019s revenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find whoever kidnapped your grandfather, uncover the truth behind <strong>The Golden Caravan</strong>, and maybe\u2026 just maybe\u2026 the <strong>House</strong> won't win this time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3169670?t=1764788356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/e3800fb374f37be31a34320ae16abacc5e2acc8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764788356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/93da4edb15ff65b33dfe0976673853867bff26ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764788356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/93da4edb15ff65b33dfe0976673853867bff26ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764788356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4199820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169670/extras/f780a9a9b6f3d61dd0ac59529e583b8c.avif?t=1764788356\" width=1560 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>The</strong>\u00a0<strong>Golden Caravan</strong>, kid. A place where fortunes are made, loyalties are lost, and every hand could be your last. Set in a smoky <strong>noir-inspired 1930s underworld</strong>, this joint ain\u2019t run by mobsters... birds with sharp suits and cold hearts are the ones callin